OL,3,AUS and Venezuela reach 'historic' oil
OL,4,Adeal, Trump says
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter the US arrested Venezuela's
OL,7,Fthen-President Nicolas Maduro earlier
OL,8,Fthis year, Trump vowed to tap its
OL,9,Freserves ` the world's largest. More
OL,10,Frecently, he has been under pressure to
OL,11,Fbring gas prices down at home.
OL,13,FSecretary of State Marco Rubio called
OL,14,Fthe deal "a huge win for both the
OL,15,FAmerican and Venezuelan people".
OL,16,FDetails have not been released.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
